#: ../../whatsnew/2.6.rst:1931
msgid ""
"The :mod:`datetime` module's :meth:`~datetime.datetime.strftime` methods now "
"support a ``%f`` format code that expands to the number of microseconds in "
"the object, zero-padded on the left to six places.  (Contributed by Skip "
"Montanaro; :issue:`1158`.)"
