#: ../../whatsnew/2.6.rst:2047
msgid ""
">>> list(itertools.product([1,2], [3,4], repeat=2))\n"
"[(1, 3, 1, 3), (1, 3, 1, 4), (1, 3, 2, 3), (1, 3, 2, 4),\n"
