#: ../../whatsnew/2.6.rst:2548
msgid ""
"The :mod:`threading` module API is being changed to use properties such as :"
"attr:`~threading.Thread.daemon` instead of :meth:`!setDaemon` and :meth:`!"
"isDaemon` methods, and some methods have been renamed to use underscores "
"instead of camel-case; for example, the :meth:`!activeCount` method is "
"renamed to :func:`~threading.active_count`.  Both the 2.6 and 3.0 versions "
"of the module support the same properties and renamed methods, but don't "
"remove the old methods.  No date has been set for the deprecation of the old "
